  m_Name: Ending_StayInValley
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Ending
  endingTitle: Valley
  titleDA: Livet i dalen
  descriptionDA: "Pandaen bliver i dalen! \n\nHer er masser af bambus, men ogs\xE5
    mange mennesker, st\xF8j og veje. \n\nB\xE5de pandaer og mennesker har brug for
    plads. Ved at beskytte skovene og holde dem intakte kan vi hj\xE6lpe k\xE6mpepandaerne
    med at leve trygt! \n\nN\xE5r du bes\xF8ger zoologisk have, st\xF8tter du et
    avlsprogram, der er med til at beskytte k\xE6mpepandaer! \nOg n\xE5r du k\xF8ber
    bambusprodukter, s\xE5 kig efter FSC-m\xE6rket. Det hj\xE6lper dig med at v\xE6lge
    produkter, der er lavet med omtanke for skovene og dyrelivet. "
  titleEN: "Staying in the Valley\_"
  descriptionEN: "The panda stays in the valley! \n\nThere's plenty of bamboo, but
    also a lot of people, noise and roads. \n\nPandas and people both need space.
    By protecting forests and keeping them intact, we can help giant pandas live
    safely! \n\nWhen you visit the zoo, you support a breeding program that helps
    protect giant pandas! \nAnd when you buy bamboo products, look for the FSC label.
    It helps you choose products made with care for forests and wildlife. "
  endingImage: {fileID: 0}
